        "lang": "en",
        "markdown": "# Shell Beach Shack\n\nTacos, ceviche and frozen margaritas on Shell Beach, Gustavia.\n\nOpen daily from noon to sunset. Kitchen closes at 5pm.\n\n## Menu\n\nAll prices in US dollars. We also accept euros at the daily rate.\n\n### Tacos (two per order)\n- Fish tacos — $18\n- Shrimp tacos — $20\n- Veggie tacos — $15\n\n### Bowls\n- Tuna ceviche — $22\n- Poke bowl — $24\n\n### Drinks\n- Frozen margarita — $14\n- Local beer — $7\n- Fresh coconut — $8\n\n## Beach service\n\nLoungers and umbrellas: $40 per person for the day, including a welcome drink.\n\n## Find us\n\nShell Beach, Gustavia 97133. Walk down from the Anglican church, you can't miss us.\n\nWhatsApp: +590 690 00 25 67 · shack@shellbeachshack.example\n\nCash and cards accepted. Sorry, no reservations.\n\n© Shell Beach Shack"
      }
